        {
          "text": "Nerrinyo ninye te sujata enye, neitayu nena keek oo murto oo lmong'i neyieng ninche. Neyier nkiri enye tenebo nkeek oo murto oo lmong'i. Neisho iltung'ana meinosa, neinos ninche. Neitoki ninye adumunye alo asujaa Eliya nelo aisiaai ninye.",
